# CELL-WR-11: save top.tcl of a cell with paint, a split tile, an instance, labels, ports and properties.
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/scmos -noprompt
snap internal
load leaf
box 0 0 10 10
paint metal1
save leaf
load top
box 0 0 20 4
paint metal1
box 30 0 40 10
splitpaint ne poly
box 50 0 50 0
getcell leaf
box 2 2 2 2
label A
port make
property s v
save top.tcl
